			"notes": "Hi 😄 !\n\nIt's been a while since the last release.\nThis one has no major features but now support multiple Minecraft versions.\n(And some log4j lib update, u know that little bug)\n\nThx @JFronny for the help on porting the mod to 1.17.\n\n# New features\n* This mod is now available for 3 separate Minecraft version (1.16.5, 1.17.1 and 1.18).\n* You now need at least Java 16 (for 1.16.5) or Java 17 (for >1.17) for this mod to load.\n\n# Fixed bugs\n* Log4j update to version 2.16.0 (Log4shell vulnerability).\n* FabricLockette prevented a server to start when installed before first initialisation.\n* Private sign even without container / door attached could not be broken.\n\nAny issues or Pull requests are welcomed !\nHave a nice day !"
		},
