			"notes": "# Features and Improvements\n* Added double door support.\n* New text and sound feedback when locking with a sign.\n* Lot of code cleaning and optimization under the hood.\n* Right-click a container will not create automatically a [private] sign.\n\n# Bug fixes\n* FabricLockette now uses MojangAPI to query online UUID #10.\n* Issues when saving UUID to nbt tags.\n* Fixed crash for 1.16.5.\n\nFeel free to report any bugs with the issue tab on this GitHub.\nEnjoy !"
		},
